{"seq":3,"slug":"solo-ops-and-reliability","title":"一人运维与可靠性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/solo-ops-and-reliability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"good-enough-observability","title":"够用的可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/solo-ops-and-reliability/good-enough-observability","wordCount":3370,"readingTime":14},{"seq":2,"slug":"backups-and-data-safety","title":"备份与数据安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/solo-ops-and-reliability/backups-and-data-safety","wordCount":3390,"readingTime":14},{"seq":3,"slug":"incident-response-solo","title":"一个人的事故应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/solo-ops-and-reliability/incident-response-solo","wordCount":3446,"readingTime":14}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"一人运维与可靠性-简介\">一人运维与可靠性 简介</h1><p>产品上线只是开始——它会出错、会宕机、数据可能丢，而你是唯一一个能处理的人。没有运维团队、没有 on-call 轮值、半夜出事也只有你。本章讲清一个人怎么把运维与可靠性扛起来：先是<strong>够用的可观测性</strong>（用日志、错误追踪、uptime 监控让你在出事时<strong>能知道</strong>——而非等用户来骂），然后是<strong>备份与数据安全</strong>（数据库备份、恢复演练、绝不丢用户数据——这是独立开发不可逾越的底线），最后是<strong>一个人的事故应对</strong>（一个人怎么 on-call、怎么快速止血降级、怎么和用户坦诚沟通）。这一章的核心是：一个人无法做到大团队的可靠性，但可以做到<strong>够用</strong>——把有限精力投在「出事能知道、数据不会丢、出事能扛住」这三件最要紧的事上。</p>\n"}